hNTFarKLzj7F3oOVIh.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Il nerd sarebbe contento se la bella ragazza lo trattasse da maiale","synopsis":"After collapsing from eating raw pig liver, I've been reincarnated as a pig in Mesteria, a world run by swords and magic. The beautiful girl who saved me worked as a servant and was a member of the Yethma, a race of girls with the ability to read minds. Despite being able to hear all of the lustful fantasies of this ex-dirty, scrawny, four-eyed virgin, Jess always responded with a soft smile. Hold on, why is this girl being so nice to me...!?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/enBt0HP1rhNTFarKLzj7F3oOVIh.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Anche i maiali ballano, se li lusinghi abbastanza","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17031","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142599","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50583","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153336","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413335","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"74327","synopsis":"Jess and I have begun preparations to make our way to the royal capital. However, despite knowing that there is a man inside this pig body, this beautiful girl doesn’t seem to have even a hint of wariness! While being enthralled by the innocent girl's every move, Jess takes Pig with her to the lively city of Kiltyrie to buy something... Hold on Jess, why are you going into such a suspicious-looking alleyway?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/24pHf3GyJ08ijndg2qauSdFWk4b.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Anche i maiali ballano, se li lusinghi abbastanza","synopsis":"Jess and I have begun preparations to make our way to the royal capital. However, despite knowing that there is a man inside this pig body, this beautiful girl doesn’t seem to have even a hint of wariness! While being enthralled by the innocent girl's every move, Jess takes Pig with her to the lively city of Kiltyrie to buy something... Hold on Jess, why are you going into such a suspicious-looking alleyway?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/24pHf3GyJ08ijndg2qauSdFWk4b.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Mai innamorarsi perdutamente della propria beniamina","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17031","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142599","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50583","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153336","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413335","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"74423","synopsis":"After seeing my astonishing dance performance, which is a skill I developed through training in rhythm games, I was purchased by a ristae shop. However, while waiting for my turn to perform at the festival, I realized something. I am an ex-dirty, scrawny, four-eyed virgin who has never once received attention from large groups of people before. But it doesn't matter. Jess is wearing a maid outfit and is cheering me on. Dance for your Oshi, Pig!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b3GcQa6bdLV0yDexSmWEQmZpuK5.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Mai innamorarsi perdutamente della propria beniamina","synopsis":"After seeing my astonishing dance performance, which is a skill I developed through training in rhythm games, I was purchased by a ristae shop. However, while waiting for my turn to perform at the festival, I realized something. I am an ex-dirty, scrawny, four-eyed virgin who has never once received attention from large groups of people before. But it doesn't matter. Jess is wearing a maid outfit and is cheering me on. Dance for your Oshi, Pig!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b3GcQa6bdLV0yDexSmWEQmZpuK5.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"State attenti a come cavalcate un maiale","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17031","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142599","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50583","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153336","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413335","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"74537","synopsis":"After being stabbed by a man with a sword wound, I lost consciousness. When I awoke, I found myself in an unfamiliar forest with Jess sleeping soundly while using my stomach as a pillow. It seems she's really tired. I decided we should start moving and that Jess should ride on my back but... Cutie-pie Jess, you can't sit on me like that! As we go on our love comedy journey, Jess reveals a shocking truth to me...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eclmoK8Xck051uvAirhQIJ5e8Oa.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"State attenti a come cavalcate un maiale","synopsis":"After being stabbed by a man with a sword wound, I lost consciousness. When I awoke, I found myself in an unfamiliar forest with Jess sleeping soundly while using my stomach as a pillow. It seems she's really tired. I decided we should start moving and that Jess should ride on my back but... Cutie-pie Jess, you can't sit on me like that! As we go on our love comedy journey, Jess reveals a shocking truth to me...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eclmoK8Xck051uvAirhQIJ5e8Oa.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"I bei ragazzi nove volte su dieci sono dei furfanti","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17031","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142599","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50583","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153336","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413335","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"74660","synopsis":"Jess and I met a young Yethma named Ceres in a town we stopped by amidst our travels. Upon Jess's request, she guided us to the site of a monastery that burned down five years ago. As we were setting down some flowers at the site, a young man wielding double blades suddenly appears before us accompanied by a dog. He's cool, strong and handsome... I don't like him, he's like my natural enemy... Who on earth is this guy?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pE8engLrHRoWeXfTVyIpjOBdUne.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"I bei ragazzi nove volte su dieci sono dei furfanti","synopsis":"Jess and I met a young Yethma named Ceres in a town we stopped by amidst our travels. Upon Jess's request, she guided us to the site of a monastery that burned down five years ago. As we were setting down some flowers at the site, a young man wielding double blades suddenly appears before us accompanied by a dog. He's cool, strong and handsome... I don't like him, he's like my natural enemy... Who on earth is this guy?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pE8engLrHRoWeXfTVyIpjOBdUne.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"I sentimenti andrebbero gridati a gran voce","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17031","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142599","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50583","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153336","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413335","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"74854","synopsis":"After hearing my appeal, Naut has agreed to join us on our journey. We set off to the royal capital along with Naut's companion, the perverted dog Rossi, by our side and Ceres's prayers on our backs. But in the next city that we arrive at, I learn about an incomprehensible truth about Yethmas... It seems I'm going to have to interrogate Naut about that incident. It's about what you were doing when you were alone with a drunken Jess last evening...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aNOutLvVxyPtv6AsuCyBnf0bMvr.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"I sentimenti andrebbero gridati a gran voce","synopsis":"After hearing my appeal, Naut has agreed to join us on our journey. We set off to the royal capital along with Naut's companion, the perverted dog Rossi, by our side and Ceres's prayers on our backs. But in the next city that we arrive at, I learn about an incomprehensible truth about Yethmas... It seems I'm going to have to interrogate Naut about that incident. It's about what you were doing when you were alone with a drunken Jess last evening...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aNOutLvVxyPtv6AsuCyBnf0bMvr.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Non esistono due fiori identici fra loro","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17031","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142599","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50583","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153336","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413335","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"75017","synopsis":"Jess and I hear the voice of a young girl Yethma named Blaise calling for help. After finding out about this, Naut takes Rossi and rushes in the direction of the voice. Chasing after him, the two of us also scramble to the source of the voice... However, my human senses smell something fishy about all of this. Will we be okay jumping in like this?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qcF43TSetuVCRdNRoKe1mf7A5Wc.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Non esistono due fiori identici fra loro","synopsis":"Jess and I hear the voice of a young girl Yethma named Blaise calling for help. After finding out about this, Naut takes Rossi and rushes in the direction of the voice. Chasing after him, the two of us also scramble to the source of the voice... However, my human senses smell something fishy about all of this. Will we be okay jumping in like this?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qcF43TSetuVCRdNRoKe1mf7A5Wc.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Non ridere delle preghiere degli altri","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17031","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142599","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50583","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153336","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413335","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"75177","synopsis":"After Blaise has joined us on our journey, we made our way to the Impaling Stones. Thanks to Naut, our travels have been going well, but I can feel danger levels are steadily rising as we approach the royal capital... I must come to a decision. What am I capable of doing to help Jess, and what should I prioritize? That night, Blaise quietly pulled me aside and opened up to me about...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l03ySkUvIcJAfKoGVnsIFG3kRfO.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Non ridere delle preghiere degli altri","synopsis":"After Blaise has joined us on our journey, we made our way to the Impaling Stones. Thanks to Naut, our travels have been going well, but I can feel danger levels are steadily rising as we approach the royal capital... I must come to a decision. What am I capable of doing to help Jess, and what should I prioritize? That night, Blaise quietly pulled me aside and opened up to me about...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l03ySkUvIcJAfKoGVnsIFG3kRfO.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Vivete e solcate quella terra","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17031","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142599","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50583","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153336","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413335","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"75713","synopsis":"After I became aware that Blaise's body was in critical condition, it became clear that we must reach the royal capital as soon as possible, for her sake, as well. However, as we hurry along our journey, the thing we've been fearful of this whole time finally appears – Yethma hunters. Outnumbered, we find ourselves in an overwhelmingly disadvantageous position. Using our wits to battle against them, we must find a way out of this predicament no matter what...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x4hI4zUZX8jhf13LcAScYLA54Me.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Vivete e solcate quella terra","synopsis":"After I became aware that Blaise's body was in critical condition, it became clear that we must reach the royal capital as soon as possible, for her sake, as well. However, as we hurry along our journey, the thing we've been fearful of this whole time finally appears – Yethma hunters. Outnumbered, we find ourselves in an overwhelmingly disadvantageous position. Using our wits to battle against them, we must find a way out of this predicament no matter what...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x4hI4zUZX8jhf13LcAScYLA54Me.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","syno