al","id":"50583","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153336","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413335","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"76009","synopsis":"We finally understood what Blaise meant when she said to \"Appeal to the king\" and have made it into the royal capital. However, there are still many unanswered questions... Why do all the Yethma girls have collars on their necks? Why do their lives meet such a horrible fate? It's finally time to learn the truth and what it will take for me to return to my human body...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pbRq1VqNW5OAxL7PbBYNISWf3Ac.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"We finally understood what Blaise meant when she said to \"Appeal to the king\" and have made it into the royal capital. However, there are still many unanswered questions... Why do all the Yethma girls have collars on their necks? Why do their lives meet such a horrible fate? It's finally time to learn the truth and what it will take for me to return to my human body...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pbRq1VqNW5OAxL7PbBYNISWf3Ac.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17031","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142599","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50583","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153336","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413335","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"76870","synopsis":"After hearing the truth from the king, Jess and I were spending the remaining time we had together. At this time, she opened up to me the \"true reason\" why I was brought here to this isekai (Mesteria). My fellows, please watch throu